Today we've released a second massive update with a new model for every animal. This update includes eight new models: bear, fox, boar, rabbit, deer stag, deer doe, wolf, eagle. Also, there are a few general fixes and improvements.
This is our last major update before the third chapter, small fixes and improvements will be released on an ongoing basis.

[img]http://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/30565060/6ce24c06abb63452d2ee3054c62692510fe73831.png[/img]

[img]http://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/30565060/7e370e8c8e74a23f75495885cef5282830b1f331.png[/img]

[img]http://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/30565060/5e2f220d5b40d78e60cdf15c38cb088482e01cee.png[/img]

[h1]Changelist:[/h1]
[b]1. Features:[/b]
- new animal models;
- HDR colors are used to compute environment lighting;
- nice new realtime reflections on some surfaces;
- new options in the settings menu;
- animals will avoid collisions with characters (experimental). 
[b]2. Fixes:[/b]
- fixed an issue when ALT+TAB could crash the player's OS;
- characters will run for longer distances; 
- locations has been slightly redesigned;
- fixed a glitch with occasional deformation of some objects (experimental);
- fixed a glitch when the player sees through geometry if he stands close to some objects (experimental);
- UI improvements;
- languages improvements;
- code maintenance.

[i]If you have any major issues with this version, please go to properties -> beta-versions tab and choose “_laststable” version.[/i]

Enjoy! 
--FVCE Team

